.TH V2ENGINE 1 "September 2026" "V2Engine 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
v2engine \- lightweight GTK4 system proxy client
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B v2engine
.SH DESCRIPTION
V2Engine imports supported proxy links from the clipboard and routes system
traffic through a selected server using a sing-box TUN interface.
The graphical application runs without root privileges. Polkit requests
authorization only when system networking is started or stopped.
.SH SHORTCUTS
.TP
.B Ctrl+V
Import one or more newline-separated server configs from the clipboard.
.TP
.B Ctrl+C
Copy the selected server config.
.TP
.B Delete
Delete the selected server.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/v2engine/servers.json
User server and bypass-domain configuration, stored with mode 0600.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR pkexec (1)
